The source under this directory (src/) builds loadable Linux kernel modules.

SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-only

These modules declare MODULE_LICENSE("GPL") and resolve kernel symbols
(including GPL-only symbols such as kallsyms_lookup_name) at load time, so they
are derivative works of the Linux kernel and are licensed under version 2 of
the GNU General Public License, as published by the Free Software Foundation.

